      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to slowly increase it, i want to go all in and really fix my diet now. if i just make sure i eat the same amount of spinach every single morning, wouldn't that be fine since it's consistent? like, if my body just gets used to that amount of vitamin k, wouldn't the warfarin just work with it? honestly i feel way too healthy to keep going back to the doctor every time i change my breakfast.",
